    {
      "bbox": [
        698,
        845,
        1401,
        1406
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Nothing contained herein shall be\nconstrued to bar any religious or\ndenominational institution or organization, or\nany organization operated for charitable or\neducational purposes, which is operated,\nsupervised or controlled by or in connection\nwith a religious organization, from limiting\nemployment or giving preference to persons\nof the same religion or denomination or\nfrom making such selection as is calculated\nby such organization to promote the\nreligious principles for which it is\nestablished or maintained. The regulations\nshall set forth this exemption for religiously-\nsponsored organizations and provide for the\ndischarge of the Bureau's responsibilities in\na manner consistent with such exemption.\"",
